WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.980
<b>Fallen Messiah</b>

00:00:05.140 --> 00:00:08.280
Is that... military weaponry?

00:00:09.570 --> 00:00:11.900
I've never even seen anything like it.

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:17.050
The 13th Special Armored Squad?

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:19.260
Do they wanna burn everything down?

00:00:20.710 --> 00:00:24.620
Well, I must say I wasn't expecting this.

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:27.280
Why deploy them?

00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:30.630
They're way overkill for a rescue operation!

00:00:32.020 --> 00:00:33.900
<i>It's no rescue op.</i>

00:00:34.470 --> 00:00:39.310
<i>The Restoration Bloc just made the decision 
to throw Jinkoku-sha to the wolves.</i>

00:00:39.630 --> 00:00:43.900
<i>Their objective is to capture 
all the EX-ARMs, including Number 11</i>

00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:45.660
<i>and Beta.</i>

00:00:46.240 --> 00:00:50.580
<i>And they'll do whatever it takes 
to complete those objectives.</i>

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:53.560
<i>Whether it involves killing Jinkoku-sha...</i>

00:00:54.370 --> 00:00:56.030
<i>or your squad.</i>

00:00:56.030 --> 00:00:58.670
<i></i>These<i> are the JSDF's newest toys?</i>

00:00:58.670 --> 00:01:01.430
<i>What can these massive clumps 
of metal even do?</i>

00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:13.260
We're bouncing, Minami!

00:01:21.930 --> 00:01:24.860
<i>Huh, you're better than I expected.</i>

00:01:25.680 --> 00:01:27.520
<i>Hey, that's no fair!</i>

00:01:28.800 --> 00:01:31.240
What's gotten into Beta?

00:01:31.240 --> 00:01:35.980
Amaterasu has launched
a cyberattack on Beta, too.

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:37.980
Akira!

00:01:38.480 --> 00:01:39.490
We're getting outta here!

00:01:45.020 --> 00:01:45.750
Soma.

00:01:47.020 --> 00:01:50.840
With Jinkoku-sha freed, 
we no longer need to follow Beta's orders.

00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:52.170
Go, sir.

00:01:52.880 --> 00:01:53.670
Alma!

00:01:55.510 --> 00:01:57.400
Yes, Master.

00:03:32.730 --> 00:03:36.150
You should be safe here for the time being.

00:03:37.180 --> 00:03:42.030
We're here guarding Jinkoku-sha 
on the Restoration Bloc's orders.

00:03:42.030 --> 00:03:43.700
Why would the JSDF suddenly attack us?

00:03:44.250 --> 00:03:47.560
The bigwigs probably gave up 
on finding a solution here

00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:51.150
and decided to get rid of all of us, 
including Jinkoku-sha.

00:03:51.150 --> 00:03:52.710
What?

00:03:52.710 --> 00:03:55.210
Man, if only I had Ogre right now...

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:58.560
No chance. 
The Bloc would never sign off on it.

00:03:58.560 --> 00:04:01.320
<i>Actually, there is a chance.</i>

00:04:01.720 --> 00:04:02.960
Chikage?

00:04:02.960 --> 00:04:04.720
<i>We still have options.</i>

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:09.120
<i>Say what? You want to ask the US Army 
to help deploy Ogre?!</i>

00:04:09.120 --> 00:04:12.230
<i>Are you trying to make enemies 
out of the Bloc?!</i>

00:04:12.720 --> 00:04:17.230
They went on my shitlist the moment they decided 
my squad's lives weren't important.

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:21.760
<i>She's absolutely right. 
And I got the PM's approval.</i>

00:04:21.760 --> 00:04:24.960
<i>I was given back full control of the Counter
EX-ARM Squad as of ten minutes ago.</i>

00:04:24.960 --> 00:04:27.290
<i>It's no longer under External
Affairs 4's command.</i>

00:04:29.240 --> 00:04:30.780
Go, Chief!

00:04:30.780 --> 00:04:34.670
<i>Hold up! 
You're forgetting something important!</i>

00:04:34.670 --> 00:04:37.960
<i>Even if you do deliver Ogre there, 
Number 00 can't connect to it!</i>

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:42.160
<i>He needs his gateway unlocked via Alma!</i>

00:04:42.160 --> 00:04:45.660
<i>But she's still under enemy control!</i>

00:04:46.640 --> 00:04:49.050
Oh, right.

00:04:49.050 --> 00:04:51.820
Not much good it'd do just sitting there.

00:04:51.820 --> 00:04:52.640
Well...

00:04:52.640 --> 00:04:55.690
All we need to do is take Alma back, right?

00:04:58.210 --> 00:05:00.700
I'll get the job done.

00:05:02.230 --> 00:05:03.080
Copy that.

00:05:03.080 --> 00:05:06.280
This briefing's over. Await further orders.

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:08.720
<i>W-Wait a second!</i>

00:05:08.720 --> 00:05:11.830
You've got no say in this anymore. Laters.

00:05:12.680 --> 00:05:15.820
So, can you walk the talk?

00:05:15.820 --> 00:05:17.830
What's your plan to get Alma back?

00:05:18.850 --> 00:05:20.260
Well, uh...

00:05:22.050 --> 00:05:24.760
An advertising hologram.

00:05:24.760 --> 00:05:27.050
Wow, that's some impressive work.

00:05:29.120 --> 00:05:30.580
They're here!

00:05:35.490 --> 00:05:37.060
I'll stop Alma.

00:05:45.110 --> 00:05:47.580
So it's you, Minami.

00:05:48.110 --> 00:05:50.620
Ygg will take you on!

00:05:52.840 --> 00:05:53.950
Stay out of my way!

00:05:54.350 --> 00:05:56.000
No point hiding.

00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:58.620
Just hand over Jinkoku-sha.

00:05:58.620 --> 00:06:00.540
If not, you'll die here and now.

00:06:01.060 --> 00:06:03.900
Tell me one thing, Alma.

00:06:03.900 --> 00:06:06.680
We're still partners, right?

00:06:07.680 --> 00:06:10.460
My loyalty is to Master alone.

00:06:11.860 --> 00:06:14.660
Okay, got it.

00:06:14.660 --> 00:06:16.040
Minami?

00:06:16.040 --> 00:06:18.060
Akira, I need a favor.

00:06:18.060 --> 00:06:20.090
Why don't you show yourself already?

00:06:23.730 --> 00:06:25.940
It's too bad, Minami!

00:06:44.370 --> 00:06:45.420
How?

00:06:46.040 --> 00:06:47.640
Did you know, Alma?

00:06:47.640 --> 00:06:53.260
Apparently, you always leave your left side 
wide open when you move in for the kill.

00:06:54.020 --> 00:06:56.140
When did I develop that habit?

00:06:57.090 --> 00:07:02.150
Well, you always had me 
cover you on the left.

00:07:08.530 --> 00:07:10.000
Is that so?

00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:12.860
Anyway, I suggest you hurry up 
and neutralize me.

00:07:17.720 --> 00:07:18.400
Alma!

00:07:18.400 --> 00:07:19.540
Watch out!

00:07:23.630 --> 00:07:24.820
Minami?

00:07:27.810 --> 00:07:30.090
Alma, are you okay?

00:07:30.760 --> 00:07:32.680
Why would you do that?

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:35.100
You could have avoided that easily.

00:07:35.640 --> 00:07:39.480
When I saw that your left side was wide open,

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:42.120
I realized that it's still
you in there, Alma!

00:07:49.010 --> 00:07:53.540
This is why she always
finds herself in danger.

00:07:56.120 --> 00:07:58.460
But she's important to me.

00:08:00.790 --> 00:08:01.910
Alma!

00:08:05.330 --> 00:08:07.680
Are you all right, Minami?

00:08:07.680 --> 00:08:08.570
Yeah.

00:08:08.570 --> 00:08:11.470
Forget me. Alma froze up all of a sudden.

00:08:13.670 --> 00:08:18.430
An emergency shutdown caused
by a fatal error that may be AI-related.

00:08:18.430 --> 00:08:21.000
We might be able to repair her program now!

00:08:21.480 --> 00:08:27.450
You can't. Alma's alterations need
to be undone using a specific process.

00:08:27.450 --> 00:08:30.480
And I'm the only one who has the access code.

00:08:30.480 --> 00:08:32.990
No... Alma!

00:08:32.990 --> 00:08:35.340
You disappoint me, Al Jarde!

00:08:35.340 --> 00:08:37.950
I thought you were better than that!

00:08:37.950 --> 00:08:40.160
What would you know about me?!

00:08:40.800 --> 00:08:41.920
My dear!

00:08:41.920 --> 00:08:42.870
Ygg!

00:08:44.800 --> 00:08:47.830
Out with it! 
Where are Hayama Gaho and Midori?!

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:50.410
Cut it out, Jarde!

00:08:50.410 --> 00:08:54.380
Do you really think you'll be satisfied 
if you kill the old man and Midori?!

00:08:54.920 --> 00:08:59.820
My satisfaction matters not! 
They must pay with their blood!

00:09:00.720 --> 00:09:03.480
You and Minami both lost your families 
just the same!

00:09:03.480 --> 00:09:07.060
And you can trace it all back 
to Beta's terror attack!

00:09:07.060 --> 00:09:10.840
The humans dove headfirst 
into an endless cycle of tragedy.

00:09:10.840 --> 00:09:14.440
One of poverty, plundering, and revenge...

00:09:14.440 --> 00:09:16.880
One where malice bred further malice!

00:09:16.880 --> 00:09:19.410
Could you ask for a more entertaining show?!

00:09:19.820 --> 00:09:23.560
He's enjoying watching human animosity 
loop back onto itself!

00:09:23.560 --> 00:09:25.410
Your quest for revenge is part of it, too!

00:09:25.410 --> 00:09:29.390
My revenge... was just some
 entertainment for Beta?

00:09:29.390 --> 00:09:33.420
Yeah. If you let anger consume you, 
you'll play right into his hands!

00:09:34.040 --> 00:09:36.960
It's too easy to wallow in sorrow forever.

00:09:36.960 --> 00:09:39.450
Getting over it is the real challenge.

00:09:39.450 --> 00:09:44.430
And I'm sure your family wants 
to see you overcome it and smile again!

00:09:44.430 --> 00:09:47.940
Never in a million years!

00:09:49.040 --> 00:09:50.160
You okay, Ygg?

00:09:50.160 --> 00:09:52.430
I can still move.

00:09:52.430 --> 00:09:55.440
We don't stand a chance fighting him head-on. 
I have another plan.

00:09:56.230 --> 00:09:57.480
Is this a game to you?

00:09:57.480 --> 00:10:00.680
Do you really believe 
you can toy with me like that?!

00:10:04.160 --> 00:10:08.170
<i>Hayama Midori? She showed herself?!</i>

00:10:18.500 --> 00:10:20.200
<i>A hologram?!</i>

00:10:23.690 --> 00:10:26.490
We used an advertising hologram.

00:10:26.490 --> 00:10:30.310
Seems that the red mist 
is clouding your judgment.

00:10:31.110 --> 00:10:34.160
Al Jarde, turn Alma back to normal.

00:10:34.160 --> 00:10:35.770
Kill me now!

00:10:35.770 --> 00:10:38.200
I'd rather die than abandon my revenge!

00:10:39.320 --> 00:10:42.280
Dude, what made you like this?

00:10:42.820 --> 00:10:44.400
Anger!

00:10:44.400 --> 00:10:47.930
Anger is the mother of all invention!

00:10:47.930 --> 00:10:54.350
It has propelled mankind 
to civilizational progress and battle prowess!

00:10:54.350 --> 00:10:56.240
It is what drives humans!

00:10:56.240 --> 00:10:57.120
Shoot!

00:10:57.120 --> 00:11:02.330
I dragged your brother into this mess! 
I took away your partner-in-arms!

00:11:02.330 --> 00:11:04.540
So hate me and unleash your rage on me!

00:11:04.540 --> 00:11:07.640
What you're feeling isn't anger. 
It's despair.

00:11:09.890 --> 00:11:13.070
Having your family killed 
must've hurt you far more than you realize.

00:11:13.070 --> 00:11:15.720
Soma must be feeling 
the same despair and sorrow.

00:11:15.720 --> 00:11:18.350
Are you saying you didn't feel despair?!

00:11:18.350 --> 00:11:22.910
Did you feel nothing 
when you saw your parents' sorry carcasses?!

00:11:24.280 --> 00:11:28.880
Well, I saw them, 
but I've forgotten all about it now,

00:11:28.880 --> 00:11:32.750
including how angry and sad I felt 
when I realized they were dead.

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:38.000
I mean, the memories we made before that

00:11:38.690 --> 00:11:40.580
shine far brighter.

00:11:42.820 --> 00:11:45.720
I know you have those memories, too!

00:11:58.530 --> 00:12:00.190
Watch out!

00:12:07.500 --> 00:12:09.080
<i>Found you.</i>

00:12:09.080 --> 00:12:10.580
Beta!

00:12:10.580 --> 00:12:14.840
<i>I was wondering where you were. 
Didn't think it'd be here.</i>

00:12:14.840 --> 00:12:17.590
<i>Oh, but it seems 
you haven't settled things yet.</i>

00:12:18.010 --> 00:12:19.090
Sir!

00:12:20.920 --> 00:12:24.180
<i>You wasted too much time! 
Wook who's here now!</i>

00:12:28.040 --> 00:12:29.600
Run away!

00:12:38.440 --> 00:12:39.930
Jarde...?

00:12:42.320 --> 00:12:45.860
Ah... I have made a grave mistake.

00:12:47.660 --> 00:12:49.160
Jarde!

00:12:49.680 --> 00:12:50.810
Take this.

00:12:51.910 --> 00:12:54.060
It's Alma's unlock key.

00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:57.660
H-How ironic it is...

00:12:59.140 --> 00:13:05.300
that I needed a foe to remind me 
how my family smiled in happier times.

00:13:06.500 --> 00:13:07.930
I also...

00:13:08.610 --> 00:13:09.930
Jarde!

00:13:20.400 --> 00:13:23.010
That's your answer, sir?

00:13:23.010 --> 00:13:27.800
I refuse to accept it! 
Is this really how you go out?!

00:13:30.880 --> 00:13:34.370
<i>Dearie me, looks wike 
we have an unexpected twist in the tale!</i>

00:13:36.580 --> 00:13:38.160
How's it look, Ygg?

00:13:38.160 --> 00:13:43.670
I need to be careful, 
but I'll go as fast as I can.

00:13:44.290 --> 00:13:48.010
Crap... We need to buy time, Minami. 
Can you move?

00:13:48.010 --> 00:13:49.480
I'm fine.

00:13:49.480 --> 00:13:51.770
I need to do something about Soma, too.

00:13:51.770 --> 00:13:53.270
There's no time to sit around!

00:13:54.930 --> 00:13:56.940
<b>Illustration by Komi Shinya</b>

00:14:01.650 --> 00:14:02.760
Soma!

00:14:03.280 --> 00:14:05.850
You need to come back 
to your senses, Soma!

00:14:05.850 --> 00:14:08.950
Jarde is dead! 
You don't have a reason to fight!

00:14:09.370 --> 00:14:13.630
My thirst for revenge won't be quenched 
as long as Jinkoku-sha lives.

00:14:13.630 --> 00:14:17.290
Didn't you see what happened to Jarde? 
Revenge will only leave you feeling empty!

00:14:17.290 --> 00:14:19.370
My debt to him is fully repaid.

00:14:19.370 --> 00:14:22.250
And now, I get my own revenge!

00:14:23.900 --> 00:14:28.050
I'm so disappointed in him for forgetting
his purpose and dying like that!

00:14:28.500 --> 00:14:29.920
Soma...

00:14:29.920 --> 00:14:31.050
Don't bother, Sis.

00:14:31.490 --> 00:14:33.060
I will surely—

00:14:37.020 --> 00:14:38.560
Soma!

00:14:42.520 --> 00:14:47.130
<i>Wao, cybernetics FTW. 
You'd be dead without it.</i>

00:14:47.130 --> 00:14:48.220
Shut up!

00:14:54.290 --> 00:14:56.380
Don't look at me like that.

00:14:56.380 --> 00:14:58.250
This is your brother now.

00:14:58.250 --> 00:15:02.230
You may have escaped that massacre, 
but this is my reality after surviving it!

00:15:02.790 --> 00:15:04.040
Soma...

00:15:04.850 --> 00:15:08.800
If we stick together, 
I promise you we'll find closure one day!

00:15:09.130 --> 00:15:12.800
Hmph. Still living in a fantasy, I see.

00:15:13.620 --> 00:15:15.310
An EX-ARM?

00:15:22.770 --> 00:15:24.580
Soma...?

00:15:25.230 --> 00:15:28.230
You were the mystery masked man?!

00:15:28.700 --> 00:15:33.240
I am now violence incarnate, 
and it is all directed toward my revenge!

00:15:33.240 --> 00:15:37.240
Your brother's rotting corpse was possessed by fury! 
That is what I am!

00:15:43.460 --> 00:15:45.830
It's okay now, Minami.

00:15:46.500 --> 00:15:48.170
Alma...

00:15:48.170 --> 00:15:51.510
Sorry I didn't have your back 
as your partner for so long.

00:15:53.220 --> 00:15:54.510
Alma!

00:15:54.510 --> 00:15:57.210
Way to go, Ygg! Atta girl!

00:15:58.150 --> 00:16:00.650
I'm really happy, you know?

00:16:00.650 --> 00:16:08.070
You, Minami, and so many people 
tried so hard to help Alma.

00:16:08.650 --> 00:16:10.060
Watching you all,

00:16:10.060 --> 00:16:14.070
I have high hopes for the future 
that humans and androids will no doubt share!

00:16:14.070 --> 00:16:15.300
Ygg...

00:16:16.270 --> 00:16:21.550
You're celebrating the return 
of one measly android? How stupid!

00:16:21.550 --> 00:16:24.870
Sadly, he is no longer the brother you knew.

00:16:24.870 --> 00:16:26.510
Let me handle him.

00:16:26.510 --> 00:16:27.380
Got it.

00:16:28.370 --> 00:16:30.880
We'll stop you with all we have!

00:16:30.880 --> 00:16:34.190
<i>Aw, looks who's got his back 
against the wall.</i>

00:16:34.190 --> 00:16:37.770
<i>Listen, Soma, I've taken a wiking to you.</i>

00:16:37.770 --> 00:16:42.330
<i>Your hatred, your thirst for wevenge... 
is similar to mine.</i>

00:16:42.330 --> 00:16:44.890
<i>This entire world is my enemy!</i>

00:16:46.060 --> 00:16:47.150
<i>Turn right!</i>

00:16:47.680 --> 00:16:49.320
Why's it following Beta's orders?

00:16:49.320 --> 00:16:51.150
<i>Good boy.</i>

00:16:52.000 --> 00:16:52.840
<i>Now fire!</i>

00:16:52.840 --> 00:16:54.040
Look out, Minami!

00:16:55.160 --> 00:16:58.370
<i>Fire, fire! Shoot 'em to bits!</i>

00:16:58.700 --> 00:17:00.120
What's going on?!

00:17:01.060 --> 00:17:03.370
Has Beta taken over Amaterasu?

00:17:04.400 --> 00:17:07.560
Hm? Isn't Amaterasu autonomous? 
It shouldn't be possible to hack.

00:17:07.560 --> 00:17:09.450
Nah, take a close look.

00:17:11.930 --> 00:17:15.880
He's plugged into Amaterasu 
and is controlling it directly.

00:17:15.880 --> 00:17:21.030
But it's bleeding-edge tech. 
It should be encrypted to hell and back.

00:17:22.110 --> 00:17:25.130
Beta has the same hacking prowess 
as Natsume Akira.

00:17:25.130 --> 00:17:30.300
No, even better, 
because it's not limited by the police.

00:17:30.300 --> 00:17:34.160
Who could've imagined there were two 
of the same EX-ARM?

00:17:34.650 --> 00:17:38.160
It's the only exception. 
Hence the name "Beta."

00:17:45.160 --> 00:17:47.710
<i>Let's get this fun show on the road!</i>

00:17:47.710 --> 00:17:51.420
No... Did all the Amaterasu 
fall into Beta's hands?

00:17:53.330 --> 00:17:57.300
<i>They're all over the iswand, 
not just in the stadium.</i>

00:17:59.280 --> 00:18:01.680
<i>You have nowhere left to run.</i>

00:18:01.680 --> 00:18:04.250
<i>I'll turn you all into mush, one at a time.</i>

00:18:04.250 --> 00:18:05.370
<i>Go!</i>

00:18:08.130 --> 00:18:09.440
Stop it!

00:18:09.950 --> 00:18:14.960
<i>Ooh, so thweatening 
for a useless little eyeball.</i>

00:18:14.960 --> 00:18:18.030
<i>What do you even think you can do?</i>

00:18:18.440 --> 00:18:22.590
Dammit! Can't we get Ogre over here?!

00:18:22.590 --> 00:18:25.340
Impossible. We're surrounded
by the Amaterasu.

00:18:25.340 --> 00:18:28.960
What? But we worked so hard to get you back!

00:18:28.960 --> 00:18:30.560
<i>Check and mate.</i>

00:18:30.560 --> 00:18:31.930
<i>GG.</i>

00:18:33.040 --> 00:18:38.570
Shit, shit! Is this really the end?

00:18:38.570 --> 00:18:41.770
Am I gonna fail to protect 
the people dear to me yet again?!

00:18:41.770 --> 00:18:43.980
<i>Don't give up, Natsume Akira!</i>

00:18:45.910 --> 00:18:47.550
Chief Shiga?

00:18:47.550 --> 00:18:50.170
<i>The power you seek is on its way to you.</i>

00:18:50.650 --> 00:18:52.650
<b>Tokyo Bay Megafloat - Offshore</b>

00:18:51.670 --> 00:18:55.640
It will let you 
turn this hopeless situation on its head!

00:19:01.070 --> 00:19:02.040
What's that?

00:19:02.040 --> 00:19:03.600
A U.S. missile?

00:19:03.600 --> 00:19:04.240
No...

00:19:04.900 --> 00:19:06.950
It's happening!

00:19:07.750 --> 00:19:09.600
Come to me, Ogre!

00:19:09.600 --> 00:19:11.750
I am right here!

00:19:11.750 --> 00:19:15.140
<i>Whoa, sucks to be you!</i>

00:19:15.680 --> 00:19:18.320
<i>I'm gonna take Ogre for myself.</i>

00:19:18.320 --> 00:19:19.510
What?

00:19:19.510 --> 00:19:24.260
You can't beat my
unrestrained hacking abilities.

00:19:24.720 --> 00:19:29.740
If Beta takes Ogre too, 
this will really become hell on earth!

00:19:30.420 --> 00:19:32.770
The cavalry's here!

00:19:33.080 --> 00:19:34.270
<i>What the...?</i>

00:19:34.720 --> 00:19:35.770
Is that...

00:19:36.120 --> 00:19:38.780
You'd forgotten all about me, hadn't ya?

00:19:38.780 --> 00:19:39.980
Kimura?!

00:19:39.980 --> 00:19:41.550
Don't tell me, that box is...

00:19:41.550 --> 00:19:44.090
It's Number 00 Alpha!

00:19:44.090 --> 00:19:46.150
You carried it out of the MPD?!

00:19:46.780 --> 00:19:49.480
Yeah, I asked the chief for permission.

00:19:49.480 --> 00:19:53.290
If I connect to Ogre directly, 
we won't have to worry about Beta hacking in.

00:19:53.690 --> 00:19:56.290
Let's go, Akira. 
I'm gonna take you offline for a sec.

00:19:59.760 --> 00:20:02.260
Got it! I'm putting my life in your hands!

00:20:13.080 --> 00:20:15.140
<i>All my senses are offline.</i>

00:20:15.700 --> 00:20:19.380
<i>The last time this happened, 
I was scared shitless.</i>

00:20:19.800 --> 00:20:21.990
<i>But I feel no fear now.</i>

00:20:24.860 --> 00:20:27.330
<i>Hell, I'm even excited.</i>

00:20:27.330 --> 00:20:31.060
<i>I know my squadmates have my back.</i>

00:20:31.650 --> 00:20:34.700
<i>And I wanna repay them by having theirs!</i>

00:20:35.710 --> 00:20:38.820
<i>That's why I'm gonna fight...</i>

00:20:39.480 --> 00:20:44.050
<i>with every ounce of strength I have!</i>

00:20:45.710 --> 00:20:47.450
Minami! Alma!

00:20:50.320 --> 00:20:53.620
<i>Please, Akira, put an end 
to this hopeless scenario.</i>

00:20:58.530 --> 00:21:01.280
Officer Uezono Minami's genetic key confirmed.

00:21:01.710 --> 00:21:08.120
EX-ARM Number 00 Alpha's 
full networking capabilities unlocked!

00:21:13.490 --> 00:21:14.430
<i>Shit!</i>

00:21:14.430 --> 00:21:16.950
<i>Shit! Shit! Shit! Shit! Shiiieeet!</i>

00:21:18.630 --> 00:21:19.740
Akira!

00:21:40.570 --> 00:21:44.570
That exoframe's a lot different 
from when he fought Elmira.

00:21:45.920 --> 00:21:48.650
<i>It's Ignis Type-03 EX...</i>

00:21:49.030 --> 00:21:51.050
<i>Ogre's latest version!</i>

00:23:25.890 --> 00:23:27.850
I'm an android just like him.

00:23:27.850 --> 00:23:32.340
We may be foes, 
but I can understand his pain.

00:23:32.340 --> 00:23:35.850
Next time, on <i>EX-ARM:</i> 
"Battle 010 - Genes of the Original Sin."

00:23:34.470 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>Genes of the Original Sin</b>

00:23:36.220 --> 00:23:38.810
I'll put him out of his misery!
